# Local analysis working directories, both reproducible from the volume: `data/` is the mirror
# `Vol` fetches into, `out/` is where an ad-hoc run's tables, CSVs and figures go.
#
# `faithfulness/` is NOT ignored (2026-09-21). It was, on the reasoning that everything under
# results/ is reproducible from the volume -- but eval 1's faithfulness output IS the paper's
# numbers, and a number the paper cites has to be in the history, diffable, and readable without
# $51 of GPU and a Modal token. So `results/faithfulness/` is committed and `out/` stays the
# scratch path for everything else; keep ad-hoc runs under `--out results/out/<name>`.
data/
out/
